
delete all

bfacf load mscl/3.1

bfacf centre off
spec bfacf

% don't show all the lattice
bfacf latshow 25

% left slab
bfacf box -20 -20 -20 -16 20 20

% right slab
bfacf box 16 -20 -20 20 20 20

% connecting pipe
bfacf fill -16 -3 -3 16 3 3

% empty interior of pipe
bfacf clear -17 -2 -2 17 2 2



% don't forget to refill the location where the knot is!
bfacf fill

txt clobber on
txt font 2
txt fill off
txt cent
txt c -44 "configuration 1"
